{"text": "electrician", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">electric</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">-ian</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Noun", "definitions": [{"definition": "A tradesperson who installs, repairs and maintains electrical wiring and equipment.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "(archaic) A scientist who studies electricity.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["US", "/\u026a\u02ccl\u025bk\u02c8t\u0279\u026a\u0283\u0259n/"], ["UK", "/\u026a\u02ccl\u025bk\u02c8t\u0279\u026a\u0283(\u0259)n/"]]}